title: ISSUE-30

Sorting of issues, for instance, should be done in natural order. //i.e.//

* `ISSUE-1`
* `ISSUE-10`
* `ISSUE-2`

should be

* `ISSUE-1`
* `ISSUE-2`
* `ISSUE-10`

This is now implemented in `0.0.7` using the `naturalSort` method in [[$:/plugins/ruivieira/devthing/utils.js]].